    "innovation": "This paper introduces Climate Downscaling with Stochastic Interpolants (CDSI), a probabilistic, data-driven framework that efficiently transforms coarse global climate simulations into high-resolution regional ensembles, providing a direct, single-model alternative to complex multi-stage methods.",
